WEBVTT

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:08.990
Keith? What's wrong?

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.120
Don't cry, Keith.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.260
Huh?!

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.670
Keith!

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.530
I'm right here!

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.380
Keith! Keith!

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.520
<i>I promise I'll come save you.</i>

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.020
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.020
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>Just wait for me, Keith!</i>

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.520
<b>Episode 11
Keith Disappeared... Part 3</b>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:50.520
That's the mansion Alexander 
indicated yesterday.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.280
It's oddly well-guarded.

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.680
Well, Maria? Can you sense any dark magic?

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.880
Yes.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.870
I see the same type 
of black fog I saw yesterday.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.300
If Keith's in that mansion, 
we have to save him right away!

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:09.130
We can't just charge into 
a mansion that's so heavily guarded.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:11.780
Just calm down a bit.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.120
Right... Sorry.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:19.180
But there is a good chance 
Keith is in there, right?

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:20.490
What shall we do?

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:21.600
Hmm...

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.180
Th-That mansion is dangerous.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:29.150
I sense something far more terrifying 
than anything we've faced before.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:33.520
It looks as if it's enveloping 
the entire mansion itself.

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:36.410
I do think it's a pretty dangerous place.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:39.870
I can't see magical power that clearly,

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:43.200
but just being here 
is sending chills down my spine.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:48.410
Very well. I'll try contacting 
the Department of Magic first.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.620
How'd it go?

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:04.650
I've decided to request backup from the 
Department of Magic before we proceed.

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:08.520
So when will we be able to go to the mansion?

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.440
Reinforcements will arrive 
tomorrow, so after that.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.820
I can't wait that long!

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:17.880
I understand that it's a dangerous place.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.790
But if that's really where Keith is,

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:25.370
there's no telling whether 
he'll still be safe tomorrow!

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:27.240
Catarina...

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:33.320
Lady Larna, can't you allow me to go into 
that mansion now, even if I have to go alone?

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.750
I ask the same.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.450
I won't let you go in alone.

00:02:37.450 --> 00:02:41.510
I'll go with her. Could you 
please grant us permission?

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.260
Are you serious about this?

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.980
Of course.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:53.510
Hmm... I can't allow the two of you 
to go sneaking off on your own.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:56.940
All right. We'll go in with 
the group we have here, then.

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.700
Thank you so much, Lady Larna!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.510
But we can't do it right this minute.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:05.870
First, we need to find a 
place we can get in through.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.680
Sora, can you do that?

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:08.730
Of course.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.160
Will you be okay on your own?

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.730
I'm used to doing this sort of thing.

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:14.250
Just leave it to me.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.610
U-Um, Prince Geordo...

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:23.770
Thank you for agreeing with me.

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:31.680
I know there's no stopping you when 
you have that look on your face.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.220
What look on my face?

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:37.560
The one you make when you've made up 
your mind about how things must be.

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:38.780
Oh...

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.210
Also, I knew

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:45.370
that you would rush in 
to save him right away.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.280
That's just the kind of person you are.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:53.260
If there's someone in need of help, 
you just run straight toward them,

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.780
even if it's more than you can handle alone.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.610
You're saying I'm reckless, aren't you?

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:06.470
But I am quite fond of that part of you.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:10.920
Because if I were the one 
captured instead of Keith,

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:13.870
I know you'd rush to save me in the same way.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:15.350
Of course I would!

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:23.820
I truly love that part of you.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:24.850
Huh?!

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:28.750
So once this is all over, 
you'd better be ready.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.290
We'll enter via the back gate.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.250
Follow after Lady Larna and me.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.040
Are you okay, Maria?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.520
You don't need to force yourself.

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:47.310
I might be able to help in some way.

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:48.640
And...

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:52.510
As long as I'm with you, 
I can handle anything.

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.810
I can face any enemy.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:58.520
Thanks, Maria. I'll be counting on you, then.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.500
Right!

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.990
So, um... What do we do now, exactly?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.070
Would you mind waiting just a bit longer?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:12.700
Wh-What's that?!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.770
Over there!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.350
Okay, now's our chance.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:29.240
Alexander, which way is Keith?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.060
The presence of dark magic 
is getting stronger!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.690
Wh-Who are you people?!

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.160
Damn you!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.510
He's not bad.

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:12.220
Whoops. Maybe that was too much.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.390
It's all right.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.690
I'll heal his wounds.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:18.330
<i>A-Awesome!</i>

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.360
<i>If this were an RPG, 
we'd be the best party around!</i>

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.440
Ow!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.230
Where is Keith Claes?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.830
Wh-Who?! I dunno what you're talking about!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:30.030
I-I mean it! I don't know who that is!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.220
Really? Then you can take a little nap.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.460
He didn't seem to be lying.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.980
Let's move on.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.800
In there!

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.030
Hey! Get a hold of yourself!

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.370
Hey, do you live in this mansion?

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:13.240
Do you know where Keith Claes is?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:17.510
Keith... That monster...

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:19.580
I must see him die!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.580
Are you the one who took Keith?

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.400
I was the heir to the household 
of Viscount Coleman,

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.900
but that position was taken from me.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.980
It wasn't my fault.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:35.010
It was my tutor's fault that my 
academic ability never improved,

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:39.500
and the reason our servants kept quitting 
was because they were incompetent!

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:42.990
Yet my father and my younger 
brother looked down on me,

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:45.950
stripped me of my status, 
and ran me out of the family!

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.780
And after I had lost everything,

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.560
<i>he</i> showed up.

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:07.000
Just because he had magic, 
he was taken in by the duke.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:11.680
Why does the child of a mistress 
get to enjoy a happy life?!

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:15.160
Why only him, when I'm so miserable?!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.790
I won't stand for it! I won't! I won't!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:21.180
You're absolutely right.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:24.900
What an unfortunate man you are.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.730
I will help to assuage your soul.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:34.320
I want Keith to fall like I did... 
No, I want him to fall farther!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:38.660
I want to send him to the depths and 
watch him crawl around pathetically!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.800
But no matter how much I torture him,

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:43.470
he won't beg for forgiveness.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:47.260
And I... only I look more and more pathetic.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.920
He should just break into pieces.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:55.080
I want to see him die!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.840
Is this...

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.410
A secret room?

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.840
So Keith is through here?

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.250
Keith!

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:28.800
Keith!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.140
Wait!

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.680
What on earth is this?

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:37.610
You can see the dark magic, too?

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.560
Yes.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.830
I can see it clearly, too.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.730
Catarina!

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:50.400
Keith! Are you okay? Hang in there!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:55.690
He's alive...

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.610
Keith is alive!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:00.320
Thank goodness.

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.750
It looks like it's safe to touch him.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.200
Maria, Sora, are you all right?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:09.330
Yes, but I can't get any closer than this.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.260
I can't, either.

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:15.980
The source of the terrifying 
aura that surrounds this mansion

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.970
is what's taken hold of Master Keith.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.180
What?!

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:22.270
It's giving off extremely 
powerful dark magic.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:24.800
Maybe that's why all of you can see it.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.430
So dark magic has been cast on Keith?

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.520
Yes, I believe so.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.950
Keith, wake up!

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:37.400
It's me, Catarina! I came to bring you home!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.720
Please! I won't worry you 
all the time anymore!

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:42.040
Just come home!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:45.120
Keith! Keith!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.660
The magic cast on him might be too strong

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.010
for any of us to break it.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:54.960
Then we need to get the one 
who cast it to undo it?

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.930
But who could have...

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:58.710
We'll have to find them.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.760
They should still be close by.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.760
We'll start searching.

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.320
Catarina and Prince Geordo, stay with Keith.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.480
<i>Mistress's child!</i>

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:24.840
<i>Monster!</i>

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.920
<i>Just get out of here!</i>

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:30.430
<i>I'm not wanted.</i>

00:11:30.860 --> 00:11:33.530
<i>I'm the child nobody needed.</i>

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:38.730
<i>Not my mother, and not 
my stepbrothers, either.</i>

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:46.140
Good boy, Keith.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:50.260
You just need to stay 
right here and keep quiet.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.200
Keith! Open your eyes, Keith!

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.520
Please wake up, Keith!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:10.110
Why...

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.210
Why did this have to happen to Keith?

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:18.540
Keith is so thoughtful and kind to everyone.

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.710
He's such a nice boy.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:25.480
He's the only little brother I have, 
and he's so precious to me.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.740
So why...

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.270
Catarina...

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.260
What is...

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.870
What is dark magic, anyway?!

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.310
When we find the one who did this,

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:50.430
I'll wrap them all up in black snakes, too!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.130
Huh? Huh?!

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.840
Catarina, is that...

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.790
What is this?

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.650
Catarina, what are you—

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.080
Stupid things!

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.320
Get off of Keith!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:33.790
Keith!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.070
I swear I'm going to save you!

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:43.880
Keith! Keith!

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:45.910
<i>Who's there?</i>

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.670
Wake up, Keith!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.600
<i>Who is that? I don't know.</i>

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:55.580
<i>I can't remember.</i>

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.790
Please! Open your eyes!

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.790
Look at me!

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.800
Hi there. You must be Keith.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.320
Welcome to the Claes family.

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:13.610
Master Keith.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.710
I'm so glad you're here.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.920
You can call me "Sister."

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:45.310
<i>Maybe it's true</i>

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:49.530
<i>that I was the child nobody needed.</i>

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:54.160
<i>But I'm not the same person I was then.</i>

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.670
Happy birthday, Keith!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:00.370
Here's your present. 
We all picked it out together.

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:05.160
<i>I now have many people 
who are precious to me.</i>

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.080
<i>If I were to disappear,</i>

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.050
<i>I'm sure they'd all be sad.</i>

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:23.760
<i>And besides, I...</i>

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.640
<i>I...</i>

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:33.870
We'll always be together from now on, Keith!

00:15:34.930 --> 00:15:37.450
<i>I made up my mind</i>

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.520
<i>to stay by Catarina's side 
and protect her forever!</i>

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.080
So...

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.880
I can't disappear in a place like this!

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:25.040
Thank you, Sister.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.470
Did that take care of it?

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.400
It can take on so many different shapes.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.710
If it had taken on a cute form, like a puppy,

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:47.950
I might have shown a little more mercy.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:52.180
Keith!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.620
Sister...

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.900
Keith!

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:01.380
Thank goodness! I'm so glad!

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:20.600
What a nice dream...

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.320
A dog?!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.900
Wh-Why...

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:38.940
Catarina!

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:44.460
How cute...

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:47.030
A-Are you okay?

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.960
That dog is made of dark magic...

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.140
You truly are an interesting person.

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:59.100
Wh-Who are you?

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:02.040
I wanted to experiment with dark magic

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:05.930
to make a dark familiar 
that would be all mine,

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.310
but it looks like you've won it over.

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:11.270
A dark familiar?

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:13.020
I mean that puppy.

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:17.700
I made it by casting dark 
magic on your brother.

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:23.840
Why were you able to take 
it for yourself, though?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:27.710
You don't even have dark magic. 
It makes no sense.

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.730
Tell me. How did you do it?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:33.370
D-Don't ask me...

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:39.220
Well, now that you've taken it, 
there's nothing I can do.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.550
I'll let you have it.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:45.560
Huh? Er... Thank you...

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.970
You truly are an interesting 
person, Catarina Claes.

00:18:52.280 --> 00:18:54.440
How do you know my name?

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:57.440
I would have liked to talk to you more,

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:59.700
but I need to go now.

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:02.090
I'll see you again sometime.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.250
What was that all about?

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.580
Are you two okay?!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:27.360
We let the woman get away,

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:29.480
but I'm glad Keith is safe.

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:30.690
Yeah!

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:32.570
That said...

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.550
Even if he was half asleep,

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:38.040
I can't believe what he did to you.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.080
That was to disinfect you.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:46.620
I can't allow any other man 
to have you, after all.

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.770
Is just once not enough to 
make you remember how I feel?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.290
Then have another.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.240
No, no! No need for that! I remember!

00:19:56.240 --> 00:19:57.760
I see...

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:02.330
<i>And so our journey to find Keith ended.</i>

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:06.920
There you go, Spot!

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:08.430
Go fetch!

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:13.350
Lady Catarina, is this really all right?

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.200
Is what all right?

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.830
I mean, that dog is...

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.960
Oh, it's fine.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:22.000
Even Lady Larna said there's no problem.

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.520
B-But...

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:28.500
Actually, the plan was to give him to the 
Department of Magic and have them study him...

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:33.460
But he just wouldn't leave me, 
so I had to keep him.

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:38.290
Good boy, Spot!

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.420
He doesn't need food, and he 
keeps quiet when I tell him to.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.080
He's just the best boy!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.720
Lady Catarina!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.240
Master Keith has awakened!

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.040
Really?!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:52.620
Yes!

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.300
I'll go see him right now!

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.690
Spot, go home!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:07.820
Sister... I'm sorry I made you worry so much.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.400
And thank you for saving me.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:13.790
Keith! I'm so relieved!

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:20.130
What's wrong, Sister?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.130
U-Um, well...

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.690
When you woke up in that mansion,

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.890
it seemed like you were still half asleep...

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.390
And, um...

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.150
I was half asleep?

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:35.800
Wait, you mean that wasn't a dream?!

00:21:35.800 --> 00:21:37.360
Y-You couldn't help it!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.510
You mistook me for someone 
you love! It happens!

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:43.370
Don't worry! I'll forget all about it!

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:45.820
You can just pretend it never happened!

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:49.460
Pretend it never happened?

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:51.680
Y-Yeah! Let's do that!

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:54.870
No.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:55.680
Huh?

00:21:56.320 --> 00:21:59.300
I don't want to pretend it didn't happen.

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:01.370
Keith?

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:03.240
Maybe I was half asleep,

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.140
but it was my first kiss with the one I love.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.510
I can't forget it.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:12.170
Eh? Uh, what does that mean?

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:16.370
Ever since I was a child,

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:19.320
I've loved you for the girl you are!

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:20.640
I love you!

00:22:20.640 --> 00:22:23.030
Huh?! Er...

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:25.290
Keith! That's enough!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.360
Catarina belongs to me.

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.660
What are you talking about, Prince Geordo?

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.080
Lady Catarina doesn't belong to you.

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.830
Mary's right. She's not yours.

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:38.760
That's right. Lady Catarina 
doesn't belong to anyone.

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:40.150
Oh, Lady Catarina!

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.720
I brought one of my favorite 
novels to help you recover!

00:22:42.720 --> 00:22:46.400
It's Keith who's recovering, not Catarina.

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:49.000
And I brought Alexander.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.200
Catarina does belong to me.

00:22:52.200 --> 00:22:55.480
No! I refuse to let you have her!

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:59.120
Oh, really? You've become 
awfully brazen, haven't you?

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:01.430
Oh, no. I wouldn't go that far.

00:23:01.430 --> 00:23:04.570
Both of you! Get away from Lady Catarina!

00:23:04.570 --> 00:23:06.530
<i>I'm so lost!</i>

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:09.660
<i>What is going on?!</i>

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:18.680
You conquered Keith, too. 
A pretty boy on each arm!
